  "solution": "%dw 2.0\noutput application/json\n---\n[ \"abc-123\" matches /[a-z]+/, \"abc-123\" contains /[a-z]+/, \"abc-123\" matches /[a-z]+-\\d+/ ]",
  "explanation": {
    "approach": "`matches` asks whether the regex describes the whole String. `contains` with a regex asks whether it occurs anywhere in it.",
    "snippets": [
